<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-americana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila americana detail-scale Turing wavelength (2.117 µm, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The onset formula, the maximum-growth eigenvalue, and the Fourier step share one Laplacian. Pass 2 adds the near-onset bracket: the fractional wavelength gap falls from 4.8% at r = 10 to 1.5% at r = 9, which is what the linear theory says as the discriminant approaches zero. r = 10 itself remains a reconstruction, not a published americana constant." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-americana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-americana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-americana-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila americana detail-scale Turing wavelength (2.117 µm, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pearson r = 0.989 and RMSE = 0.41 px against lambda(k_sigma). Sweep-grid wavelength 2.075 µm versus the assigned 2.117 µm. Pixel-sample KS is 0.4605 against a 12-bin KS reference that is a different statistic. Ablation ratio ~ 0. Detail-scale ratio 1.081 versus primordium ratio 1.446. Still one species card." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-americana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-analytical-versus-simulated-wavelength-pearson-r>,
