        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-americana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-pigment-segment-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-americana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-versus-simulation-orientation-ks-statistic>,
